OL,3,GNEWSA'Clean energy could inspire new
OL,4,Ageneration of seafarers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe seafaring son of a ship's captain
OL,7,Fhas said North Yorkshire's push to
OL,8,Fbenefit from the switch to clean energy
OL,9,Fcould inspire a new generation of
OL,10,Fmariners.
OL,12,FScarborough's Iain Butterworth was
OL,13,Fspeaking at the launch of the North
OL,14,FYorkshire Maritime and Renewable
OL,15,FCluster, a body set up to connect
OL,16,Fbusinesses, schools and colleges with
OL,17,Foffshore energy projects, like the
OL,18,FDogger Bank wind farm.
OL,20,FLast November, a report said Dogger
OL,21,FBank could benefit the UK economy by
OL,22,Fmore than #6bn.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
