OL,3,GNEWSA'Clean energy could inspire new
OL,4,Ageneration of seafarers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FButterworth said: "We're an island
OL,7,Fnation. But we don't see ourselves like
OL,8,Fthat in the way we used to. If we get
OL,9,Fthis right, the opportunities are huge
OL,10,Ffor people on North Yorkshire's coast,
OL,11,Fand across the whole county."
